title: "Exact Range-Count Envelopes Over Ordered Time Series Under Total-Variation Drift Budgets"
abstract: "LocalWindows: an exact query operator for minimum and maximum threshold-count envelopes over ordered time series under total-variation drift budgets. Python implementation, native C++ driver with exact baselines, and an in-browser query tool."
